<Layouts.app flash={@flash} current_scope={@current_scope}>
  <div class="playground">
    <header class="topbar">
      <a href="/" class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">S</span><span>Spectre<span class="brand-sub">PLAYGROUND</span></span></a>
      <div class="top-meta">
        <span class="version">0.4</span><span class="mode"><span class="status-dot"></span>{if @mode ==
                                                                                                 :openrouter,
                                                                                               do:
                                                                                                 "OpenRouter",
                                                                                               else:
                                                                                                 "Deterministico"}</span>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div :if={@error} id="session-error" role="alert" class="error-banner">{@error}</div>
    <div class="workspace">
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <p class="eyebrow">UN AGENTE, DUE SKILL</p>
        <h1>Dal sito<br /> all’azione.</h1>
        <p class="intro">Osserva, prepara, conferma. Segui ogni passaggio del tuo agente.</p>
        <div class="scenario">
          <span class="step-number">01</span><strong>Esplora un sito</strong>
          <p>Lens apre una pagina reale. Il modello prepara il messaggio.</p>
          <.button
            id="visit-site"
            class="primary-button"
            phx-click="quick"
            phx-value-command="visit"
            disabled={is_nil(@session)}
          ><.icon name="hero-arrow-up-right" class="size-4" /> Apri sito di esempio</.button>
          <.button
            id="visit-empty"
            class="text-button"
            phx-click="quick"
            phx-value-command="empty"
            disabled={is_nil(@session)}
          >Prova una pagina senza email</.button>
        </div>
        <div class="scenario">
          <span class="step-number">02</span><strong>Prova le altre Skill</strong>
          <p>Continua a lavorare anche con una conferma aperta.</p>
          <div class="quick-grid">
            <.button
              id="recall-memory"
              class="secondary-button"
              phx-click="quick"
              phx-value-command="memory"
            >Memoria</.button>
            <.button
              id="save-note"
              class="secondary-button"
              phx-click="quick"
              phx-value-command="note"
            >Salva nota</.button>
            <.button
              id="run-diagnostics"
              class="secondary-button"
              phx-click="quick"
              phx-value-command="diagnostics"
            >Diagnostica</.button>
            <.button
              id="send-notice"
              class="secondary-button"
              phx-click="quick"
              phx-value-command="notice"
            >Notifica Beam</.button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <details class="scenario memory-controls" open>
          <summary><strong>Esplora la memoria</strong></summary>
          <p>
            Cerca restituisce ricordi e fonti; richiama prepara il contesto; rifletti aggiunge osservazioni e modelli mentali.
          </p>
          <.form for={@memory_form} id="memory-form" phx-submit="memory_query">
            <.input
              field={@memory_form[:query]}
              id="memory-query"
              label="Cosa cerchi?"
              placeholder="es. Elixir"
              required
            />
            <.input
              field={@memory_form[:operation]}
              id="memory-operation"
              type="select"
              label="Operazione"
              options={[
                {"Cerca ricordi", "search"},
                {"Richiama contesto", "recall"},
                {"Rifletti con fonti", "reflect"}
              ]}
            />
            <.button id="query-memory" type="submit" class="secondary-button">Cerca in memoria</.button>
          </.form>
          <div class="quick-grid">
            <.button
              id="memory-atlas"
              class="text-button"
              phx-click="quick"
              phx-value-command="atlas"
            >Mappa</.button>
            <.button
              id="memory-knowledge"
              class="text-button"
              phx-click="quick"
              phx-value-command="knowledge"
            >Conoscenze</.button>
          </div>
        </details>
        <div class="scenario">
          <strong>Verifica il ciclo</strong>
          <p>
            Hello viene generato dal modello e interpretato da Kinetic. Il log viene scritto dopo Confermo.
          </p>
          <div class="quick-grid">
            <.button
              id="log-hello"
              class="secondary-button"
              phx-click="quick"
              phx-value-command="hello"
            >Hello + consenso</.button>
            <.button
              id="test-semantic-cache"
              class="secondary-button"
              phx-click="quick"
              phx-value-command="cache"
            >Prova parafrasi</.button>
          </div>
          <p>Cache: indice vettoriale reale, encoder deterministico di prova.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="scenario last-scenario">
          <span class="step-number">03</span><strong>Cambia argomento</strong>
          <p>Sospendi la richiesta di Ricerca. GAM ne registra la chiusura dopo 30 secondi.</p>
          <div class="quick-grid">
            <.button
              id="suspend-research"
              class="secondary-button"
              phx-click="quick"
              phx-value-command="suspend"
            >Sospendi</.button><.button
              id="resume-research"
              class="secondary-button"
              phx-click="quick"
              phx-value-command="resume"
            >Riprendi</.button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="local-note">
          <.icon name="hero-computer-desktop" class="size-4" /><span>Browser e GAM reali.<br />Email nella casella locale.</span>
        </div>
      </aside>
      <main class="chat-panel">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">CONVERSAZIONE</span><h2>Il tuo workspace</h2>
          </div><.button
            id="agent-status"
            class="icon-button"
            phx-click="quick"
            phx-value-command="status"
            title="Stato agente"
          ><.icon name="hero-signal" class="size-5" /></.button>
        </div>
        <div class="actors">
          <.button
            :for={target <- ["agent", "outreach", "knowledge"]}
            id={"target-#{target}"}
            class={["actor", @target == target && "selected"]}
            phx-click="target"
            phx-value-target={target}
          >
            <span class="actor-dot"></span>{label(target)}
            <span :if={target != "agent"} class="actor-state">{if busy?(@skills, target),
              do: "al lavoro",
              else: "skill"}</span>
          </.button>
        </div>
        <div id="messages" class="messages" phx-update="stream" phx-hook="ChatScroll">
          <article
            :for={{id, msg} <- @streams.messages}
            id={id}
            data-preview-status={Map.get(msg, :preview_status)}
            class={["message", "from-#{msg.source}", msg.kind == :presentation && "presentation"]}
          >
            <div class="message-label">
              {label(msg.source)}<span :if={msg.kind == :preview} class="preview-label">{preview_label(
                msg.preview_status
              )}</span>
            </div>
            <div
              :if={msg.kind == :presentation}
              id={"ack-#{id}"}
              phx-hook="Presentation"
              data-ref={msg.ref}
              class="message-body"
              phx-no-format
            >{msg.body}</div>
            <div :if={msg.kind != :presentation} class="message-body">{msg.body}</div>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div id="pending-requests" class="pending-requests" aria-live="polite">
          <div
            :for={pending <- @pending}
            id={"pending-#{pending.id}"}
            class="pending-card"
            data-skill={pending.skill}
            data-status={pending.status}
            data-presentation-ref={pending.presentation.ref}
          >
            <div>
              <strong>{label(pending.skill)} · {if pending.status == :foreground,
                do: "Conferma richiesta",
                else: "Richiesta sospesa"}</strong><small>{inspect(pending.operation)} · revisione {pending.revision}</small>
            </div>
            <pre class="consent-material">{pending.presentation.rendered_payload}</pre>
            <div :if={pending.status == :foreground} class="consent-actions">
              <.button
                id={"reject-#{pending.id}"}
                class="secondary-button"
                phx-click="confirm"
                phx-value-skill={pending.skill}
                phx-value-id={pending.id}
                phx-value-revision={pending.revision}
                phx-value-presentation={pending.presentation.ref}
                phx-value-answer="annulla"
              >Annulla</.button>
              <.button
                id={"confirm-#{pending.id}"}
                class="primary-button"
                phx-click="confirm"
                phx-value-skill={pending.skill}
                phx-value-id={pending.id}
                phx-value-revision={pending.revision}
                phx-value-presentation={pending.presentation.ref}
                phx-value-answer="confermo"
              >Confermo</.button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <.form for={@form} id="chat-form" phx-submit="send" phx-change="draft" class="composer">
          <.input
            field={@form[:text]}
            type="text"
            placeholder={"Scrivi a #{label(@target)}…"}
            class="chat-input"
            autocomplete="off"
            maxlength="4000"
            required
          />
          <.button
            id="send-message"
            class="send-button"
            type="submit"
            disabled={is_nil(@session)}
            aria-label="Invia messaggio"
          ><.icon name="hero-arrow-up" class="size-5" /></.button>
        </.form>
        <p class="composer-hint">
          Le anteprime non eseguono azioni. Le conferme appartengono alla singola richiesta.
        </p>
      </main>
      <aside class="inspector">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">DENTRO LA SESSIONE</span><h2>Un solo GAM Domain</h2>
          </div><span class="status-dot"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="domain-summary">
          <div><strong id="act-count">{@act_count}</strong><span>Act</span></div><div>
            <strong id="outcome-count">{@outcome_count}</strong><span>Outcome</span>
          </div><div><strong>{@revision}</strong><span>Revisione</span></div>
        </div>
        <details class="domain-detail">
          <summary>Identità e processi</summary><code>{@domain}</code><p :for={
            {skill, state} <- @skills
          }>
            {label(skill)} <code>{state[:pid]}</code>
          </p><.button id="native-message" class="text-button" phx-click="refresh_skill">Invia un messaggio OTP a Memoria</.button>
        </details>
        <div class="tools">
          <span class="eyebrow">STACK · 9 PACKAGE</span><div class="tool-grid">
            <span
              :for={tool <- @tools}
              id={"tool-#{tool}"}
              class={["tool-pill", MapSet.member?(@tool_hits, tool) && "used"]}
            ><span class="tool-dot"></span>{String.capitalize(tool)}</span>
          </div><p>Si illuminano quando un risultato attraversa il Server.</p>
        </div>
        <p :if={@last_route} id="routing-evidence" class="routing-evidence">
          Router:
          <strong>{case @last_route.strategy do
            :semantic_cache_search -> "similarità vettoriale"
            :semantic_cache_exact -> "esempio esatto"
            other -> to_string(other)
          end}</strong>
          · {@last_route.label}
        </p>
        <nav class="inspector-tabs" aria-label="Pannelli sessione">
          <.button
            :for={
              {tab, title} <- [
                {"activity", "Attività"},
                {"gam", "Registro GAM"},
                {"mailbox", "Casella"},
                {"memory", "Memoria"},
                {"logs", "Log"}
              ]
            }
            id={"tab-#{tab}"}
            class={["inspector-tab", @tab == tab && "active"]}
            phx-click="tab"
            phx-value-tab={tab}
          >{title}</.button>
        </nav>
        <div
          id="activity"
          class={["inspector-content", @tab != "activity" && "hidden"]}
          phx-update="stream"
        >
          <p id="activity-empty" class="empty-state">I passaggi del workflow appariranno qui.</p><details
            :for={{id, item} <- @streams.activity}
            id={id}
            class="event"
          >
            <summary><span class="event-kind">{item.kind}</span><time>{item.time}</time></summary><pre>{item.text}</pre>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div
          id="gam-records"
          class={["inspector-content", @tab != "gam" && "hidden"]}
          phx-update="stream"
        >
          <p id="gam-empty" class="empty-state">Nessuna azione governata ancora.</p><details
            :for={{id, item} <- @streams.records}
            id={id}
            class="event"
          >
            <summary>
              <span class="event-kind">{item.kind}</span><span class="record-ref">{String.slice(
                item.id,
                -10,
                10
              )}</span>
            </summary><pre>{item.text}</pre>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div
          id="mailbox"
          class={["inspector-content", @tab != "mailbox" && "hidden"]}
          phx-update="stream"
        >
          <p id="mail-empty" class="empty-state">
            Nessun messaggio locale. Un’email compare solo dopo la conferma e l’esecuzione.
          </p><article :for={{id, item} <- @streams.mailbox} id={id} class="mail-item">
            <span class="eyebrow">ACCETTATO LOCALMENTE · {item.time}</span><pre>{item.text}</pre>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div
          id="memory-results"
          class={["inspector-content", @tab != "memory" && "hidden"]}
          phx-update="stream"
        >
          <p id="memory-empty" class="empty-state">
            Cerca una nota salvata. I risultati sono limitati alla tua sessione.
          </p>
          <article :for={{id, memory} <- @streams.memory_results} id={id} class="mail-item">
            <p>{memory.text}</p>
            <small>Fonte: {memory.source}</small>
            <details>
              <summary>Identificatore</summary><code>{memory.id}</code>
            </details>
            <.button
              id={"forget-#{memory.id}"}
              class="text-button"
              phx-click="forget_memory"
              phx-value-id={memory.id}
            >Dimentica…</.button>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div
          id="log-receipts"
          class={["inspector-content", @tab != "logs" && "hidden"]}
          phx-update="stream"
        >
          <p id="logs-empty" class="empty-state">
            Nessun log Kinetic eseguito. Attende il consenso.
          </p>
          <article :for={{id, item} <- @streams.logs} id={id} class="mail-item">
            <strong>hello</strong><p>Logger · {item.time}</p><details>
              <summary>Ricevuta GAM</summary><pre>{item.text}</pre>
            </details>
          </article>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layouts.app>
